flowchart TD
    A["POST /api/recommendations/generate/{vulnerability_id}"] --> B[Load stored vulnerability]
    B -->|Missing| C[Return 404 vulnerability not found]
    B -->|Found| D[Build context from host, port, service,<br/>severity, type and description]

    D --> E{Local Ollama provider configured?}
    E -->|Yes| F[Request up to three evidence-only suggestions]
    F -->|Advisor failure or no usable result| G[Create deterministic safe fallback]
    E -->|No| G

    F --> H[Filter suggestions through safety and scope rules]
    G --> H
    H --> I[Format risk, priority, likelihood,<br/>impact, confidence and manual steps]
    I --> J[Persist recommendation with PENDING_APPROVAL status]
    J --> K[(recommendations table)]
    K --> L[Return 201 recommendation collection]

    NOTE[The engine does not map CWE or OWASP fields<br/>and does not execute the recommendation]
    NOTE -.-> H
